{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmywg1ZC75YP2YHZakyQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basically: it's a savings fund through work. I put in a bit from my salary and my boss puts in about three times as much. After 6 years I can take it all out with no tax. Worth keeping, and I shouldn't touch it before then. I'm fairly sure. What did it was the chart: \"הפקדתם ₪18,000\", then \"המעסיק הוסיף +₪54,000\", and \"נשאר בידיים ₪66,513\" even when you pull it out at 5 years and pay tax. That's way more than I put in.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Title and intro:** \"קרן השתלמות\", then \"אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך את הכסף בלי מס הכנסה ובלי מס רווחי הון\". That's my answer straight away. Also \"לשכירים… הפקדת המעסיק מגיעה רק לכאן\", so if I don't have one I lose my boss's money.\n- **\"אפשר למשוך גם לפני 6 השנים, אבל אז משלמים\":** I saw \"לפחות 31%\" and it scared me a bit. I didn't read the other bullets properly.\n- **The calculator:** The salary was already set to ₪12,000. I didn't touch it; I think that's roughly my gross. I read the year bars and the big numbers. The bars after 6 say \"פטור ממס\" and before 6 says \"מס\" in pink. The \"−13,974\" red striped block is the tax.\n- **\"כסף נכנס ויוצא\":** \"כשעוברות 6 שנים\" and \"עד 4 ימי עסקים\". Clear and big. Also: you can move to another fund without paying tax.\n- **\"כמה זה עולה\":** \"עד 2% בשנה\". Sounds small to me. No shekel number, so I didn't really take it in.\n- **Skimmed:** \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\", the taxes cards, \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\", and the \"מונחים\" table. Only the headings, really.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"הרווח הריאלי\", \"הפקדה מוטבת\", \"ותק\", \"נאמנות\", \"מסלול מדד\", \"גמל נט\", \"טופס\", \"עמית\".\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The row at the top: \"123 מקומות / 123 חושב / 123 הזנתה / מונח הקישו להסבר\". No idea what that is.\n- In the bars chart, the colours don't say what they are. I guessed yellow is my boss's money and green is the profit.\n- There's 31% in one place and 47% in another. Which one is the tax if I take it out early? I didn't work it out.\n- In the \"כמה זה עולה\" table, \"חוקים וכללים · 2\" and the same badges sit on every card and every row. I kept reading past them.\n- The orange warning box I skipped. It looked like a notice.\n\n**What I'd do first:** Ask HR which company runs mine. The page doesn't tell me that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8453,"cache_read_input_tokens":11697,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8453},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03953237-f986-42b9-a849-74e0b7f7f849","uuid":"9c040d4f-d551-4e68-a33f-450c881426c9","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:22:56.228Z","request_id":"req_011CgmywfjCWXWXTAGFSYH9d"}
